      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty says that disaster is coming on one nation after another, and a great storm is gathering at the far ends of the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that day the bodies of those whom the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has killed will lie scattered from one end of the earth to the other. No one will mourn for them, and they will not be taken away and buried. They will lie on the ground like piles of manure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
