          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cry, you leaders, you shepherds of my people, cry out loud! Mourn and roll in the dust. The time has come for you to be slaughtered,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25.34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hebrew has an additional word, the meaning of which is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and you will be butchered like rams.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25.34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "rams",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "vessels.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There will be no way for you to escape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You moan and cry out in distress because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.36+JER.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.36",
              "JER.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in his anger has destroyed your nation and left your peaceful country in ruins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.36+JER.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.36",
              "JER.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has abandoned his people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
