              "text": "25.38",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The LORD",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "people",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The LORD's people run away.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " like a lion that leaves its cave. The horrors of war and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s fierce anger have turned the country into a desert.",
